  "status": "DRAFT",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Pamper your cat with the Donut Cat Bed &amp; Tunnel, a versatile piece of cat furniture designed to provide endless fun and cozy relaxation. Made from durable, eco-friendly felt, this dual-use accessory combines the comfort of a soft cat bed with the excitement of an interactive tunnel.</p><p>Whether your cat is ready for a nap or in the mood to play, this multi-functional pet toy meets all their needs. The circular design offers a cozy resting spot that feels secure, while the integrated tunnel encourages exploration, exercise, and playful hide-and-seek. Ideal for kittens and adult cats alike, it adds a touch of charm to any room in your home.</p><p>Perfect for keeping your pet active and entertained, the Donut Cat Bed &amp; Tunnel is a must-have for cat lovers looking to enhance their feline\u2019s indoor environment.</p>",
