  "handle": "stainless-steel-pet-slow-feeder",
  "status": "DRAFT",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p>The \"Stainless Steel Pet Slow Feeder\" is designed to promote healthier eating habits for your pet by slowing down their feeding pace. Made from durable, high-quality stainless steel, it features a built-in neck protector that reduces strain while eating. The slow-feeding design helps prevent choking, indigestion, and bloating by encouraging pets to eat at a more controlled rate. Ideal for dogs or cats, this easy-to-clean bowl is both practical and stylish, offering a long-lasting solution for pets that tend to eat too quickly.</p>",
